    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " B'eishe-emwe, nitubamanyisa embabazi za Ruhanga ezaayorekirwe omu makanisa ag'omuri Makedonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabaire nibakigyezibwa okubonabonesibwa kwingi, okushemererwa kwabo okuhinguraine, n'obworo bwabo bwingi, bikakanya, byabareetera okugaba bingi munonga nk'abatungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba nimpamya ngu, bakagaba beekundiire nk'oku baabaasize, nangwa n'okukiraho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nibatushaba n'okweshengyereza kwingi okwikirizibwa kukwatanisa n'abarikuhwera abarikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi tibarakozire nk'oku twabaire nituteekateeka, kureka bakabanza kwehayo ahari Mukama n'ahariitwe, nk'oku Ruhanga yaakunzire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo twayehanangiririize Tito ngu, nk'oku yaatandikire ira, abe nikwo yaahikiiriza omuriimwe omurimo ogu ogw'embabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.16.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka, nk'oku murikuhingurana omuri byona, omu kwikiriza, omu kugamba, omu bwengye, omu bweziriki bwona, n'omu kukunda oku murikutukunda, mube nikwo mwahingurana n'omu murimo ogu ogw'embabazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo tindikukigamba nk'orikuragiira, kureka niinyenda kuhamya okukunda kwanyu ku kuraabe kuri okw'amazima, niinyihirira aha bweziriki bw'abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.8.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 8:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba nimumanya embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; n'obu yaabaire ari omutungi, kwonka akahinduka omworo ahabwanyu, ngu obworo bwe bubatungise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri eki nimbagambira eki ndikuteekateeka; imwe abaabandiize abandi kutandika, hahingwire omwaka, kibashemereire kukora; kandi ti kukora kwonka, kureka okukora n'okukunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka hati mbwenu mwongyereho kuhikiiriza okukora okwo; nk'oku mwayeteekateekire kukikunda, mube nikwo mwakihikiiriza n'ei mwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 12:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba ahu okukunda kuri, nikwikirizibwa nk'oku omuntu aine, ti nk'oku ataine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindikugamba ntyo kwanguhiza abandi, ngu imwe muremeerwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 9:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kureka ngu mwingaingane; ebi mushaagize omu biro ebi bimare obworo bwabo, kandi nabo ebi barishaazya biije bimare obworo bwanyu, mubone kwingaingana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 16:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Owaashangurwize bingi, taine ki yaashaagizeho; n'owaashangurwize bikye, taine ki yaakyenire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Ruhanga asiimwe, owaataire omu mutima gwa Tito obweziriki nk'obu nyine ahabwanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba taraikiriize kwija ahabw'okushaba kwaitu kwonka, kureka ahabw'obweziriki obu aine ahabwe naija kwija owaanyu ahabw'okwekundira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nitwija kumutuma hamwe n'ow'eishe-emwe, orikusiimwa omu makanisa goona ahabw'okubuurira engiri kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'ekyo kyonka; kandi hoona akatooranwa amakanisa kugyenda naitwe omu murimo ogu ogw'embabazi, itwe ogu turikukora kuhaisa Mukama ekitiinisa, kandi n'okworeka okukunda kwaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitwerinda ngu hatagira owaatubeiherera ahabw'ekiconco eki ekihango, eki turikuheereza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahakuba eki turikugyenderera n'okukora ebirikusiimwa, ti mu maisho ga Mukama kwonka, kureka n'omu maisho g'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hamwe nabo nitutuma ow'eishe-emwe ondiijo ou tugyerize kaingi, tukashanga ari omweziriki omuri bingi, kandi hati n'omweziriki okukira oku yaabaire ari, ahabw'okuba naabeesiga munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 7:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebya Tito mumanye ngu ni mugyenzi wangye ou turikukora hamwe, kandi ou tukwataniise kubaheereza; kandi eby'ab'eishe-emwe abo n'entumwa z'amakanisa ezihimbisisa Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
